sites-section-functoriality-PSh", "owner_tag": "00VC", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:7b11f07bb8ea599d6bc0f5696ba57ca1744aecf03c9a9d0b0ec9fb902c138757", "source_label": "sites-section-functoriality-PSh", "usage": "matrix-membership", "usage_source": {"after": "{", "before": ")\n", "environments": ["matrix"]}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "sites-matrix-in", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 164, "start": 160}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002", "source": " in "}, {"boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0003", "MATHSEG_0004"], "classification_witness": {"anchor": {"file": "sites.tex", "kind": "section", "matches": [{"command_byte_span": {"end": 147563, "start": 147547}, "command_hash": "sha256:2e1bd1d9a42ff74da9e648d6569da343f077d45723c55337f29f5187c30e58da", "container_byte_span": {"end": 147937, "start": 146446}, "container_hash": "sha256:57175e45ccc3d4a0159339acf34af4448e4c56834029fd33b75e9ede83ea9b79"}], "ordinal": 1, "owner_label": "sites-section-more-functoriality-PSh", "owner_tag": "00XF", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:7b11f07bb8ea599d6bc0f5696ba57ca1744aecf03c9a9d0b0ec9fb902c138757", "source_label": "sites-section-more-functoriality-PSh", "usage": "matrix-row-statement", "usage_source": {"after": " \\beta", "before": "\\\\\n", "environments": ["matrix"]}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "sites-we-have", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 199, "start": 190}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0003", "source": " we have "}], "source": "$$\n{}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V)\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{collections }\ns_{(U, \\psi)} \\in \\mathcal{F}(U) \\\\\n\\forall \\beta : (U_1, \\psi_1) \\to (U_2, \\psi_2)\n\\text{ in }{}_V\\mathcal{I} \\\\\n\\text{ we have } \\beta^*s_{(U_2, \\psi_2)} = s_{(U_1, \\psi_1)}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 1665, "start": 1395}, "source_hash": "sha256:cbc98c8b3d458d3bcc36995c9b386ac3ad93837760d0ceb05455e726f9c5bc7e"}], "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "00XF", "placeholders": {"MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n{}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V)\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\ns_{(U, \\psi)} \\in \\mathcal{F}(U) \\\\\n\\forall \\beta : (U_1, \\psi_1) \\to (U_2, \\psi_2)\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}{}_V\\mathcal{I} \\\\\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0004": "} \\beta^*s_{(U_2, \\psi_2)} = s_{(U_1, \\psi_1)}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$u : \\mathcal{C} \\to \\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\nu^p :\n\\textit{PSh}(\\mathcal{D})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\textit{PSh}(\\mathcal{C})\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0005": "$u^p\\mathcal{G} = \\mathcal{G} \\circ u$", "MATH_0006": "$u_p$", "MATH_0007": "$V \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{D})$", "MATH_0008": "${}_V\\mathcal{I} = {}_V^u\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0009": "$(U, \\psi : u(U) \\to V)$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{I}_V^u$", "MATH_0011": "$(U, \\psi) \\to (U', \\psi')$", "MATH_0012": "$\\alpha : U \\to U'$", "MATH_0013": "$\\psi = \\psi' \\circ u(\\alpha)$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0016": "${}_V\\mathcal{F} : {}_V\\mathcal{I}^{opp} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0017": "${}_V\\mathcal{F}(U, \\psi) = \\mathcal{F}(U)$", "MATH_0018": "$$\n{}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V) := \\lim_{{}_V\\mathcal{I}^{opp}} {}_V\\mathcal{F}\n$$", "MATH_0019": "$c(\\psi) : {}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V) \\to \\mathcal{F}(U)$", "MATH_0020": "$(U, \\psi)$", "MATH_0021": "${}_V\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0022": "$s \\mapsto s_{(U, \\psi)} = c(\\psi)(s)$", "MATH_0023": "${}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V) \\to {}_pu(\\mathcal{F})(V')$", "MATH_0024": "$V' \\to V$", "MATH_0025": "$\\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0026": "${}_pu\\mathcal{F}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-functoriality-PSh}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{section-functoriality-PSh}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:db40864277f138c65ec541c95e8dd7f1bbca428d2a5bb394218f0770fcab1f05", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:345771071f45a1e7b64bcfd658e8deeba2698300ebb68dbd9bdf50a8d11f7f71", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2af10267d3345a49d330d942e1c7bd1922ce0c0923f06c3ef652af99119249c5", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we revisit the material of\nSection <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0001> be a functor between categories.\nRecall that\n<MATH_0002>\nis the functor that associates to <MATH_0003> on <MATH_0004> the presheaf\n<MATH_0005>. It turns out that this functor\nnot only has a left adjoint (namely <MATH_0006>) but also a right adjoint.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nNamely, for any <MATH_0007>\nwe define a category <MATH_0008>.\nIts objects are pairs <MATH_0009>.\nNote that the arrow is in the opposite direction from the arrow\nwe used in defining the category <MATH_0010> in\nSection <REF_0002>.\nA morphism <MATH_0011> is given\nby a morphism <MATH_0012> such that\n<MATH_0013>.\nIn addition, given any presheaf of sets <MATH_0014>\non <MATH_0015> we introduce the functor\n<MATH_0016>,\nwhich is defined by the rule\n<MATH_0017>. We define\n<MATH_0018>\nAs a limit there are projection maps\n<MATH_0019>\nfor every object <MATH_0020> of <MATH_0021>.\nIn fact,\n<MATHSEG_0001>collections <MATHSEG_0002> in <MATHSEG_0003> we have <MATHSEG_0004>\nwhere the correspondence is given by <MATH_0022>.\nWe leave it to the reader to define the restriction mappings\n<MATH_0023>\nassociated to any morphism <MATH_0024> of <MATH_0025>.\nThe resulting presheaf will be denoted <MATH_0026>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bfb1b82c69c83f97c2f00f11ca077f0bf6cd0279a0e2577ee28a9d12693a30ef", "unit_id": "tag:00XF:prose-0001"}
